              },
              {
                "x": 675,
                "y": 965
              }
            ]
          },
          "presence": {
            "calypso": {
              "kind": "enter",
              "fadeMs": 2000,
              "zone": "Behind the lower-left tree, then onto the open sand",
              "from": {
                "x": 250,
                "y": 1190
              }
            }
          },
          "camera": {
            "hold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s2-settle-after-entry",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 700,
          "effects": {
            "view": "conversation"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s2-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Calypso, the goddess who lived on this island, came down to the shore. She wanted Odysseus to stay with her."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s2-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "calypso",
          "text": "“You could have a life here.”"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s2-p3",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "odysseus",
          "text": "“I have a life somewhere else.”"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s2-p4",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "calypso",
          "text": "“A life that changes. People grow old there. They leave. They forget.”"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s2-p5",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Calypso offered to make him live forever, without growing old. He would have to give up returning to his family."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s2-p6",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Odysseus looked at the woman beside him, then at the water."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s2-p7",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "odysseus",
          "text": "“Penelope will have changed. So will I.”"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s2-p8",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "calypso",
          "text": "“And that is what you want?”"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s2-p9",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "odysseus",
          "text": "“I want the chance to find her. Even if I find her older.”"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s2-p10",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Calypso said nothing. For a moment, only the water answered."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s2-p11",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "The island could keep a man alive forever. It could not make him stop missing home."
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 76
    },
