            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s3-settle-after-entry",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 700,
          "effects": {
            "view": "messenger"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s3-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "That afternoon, while Odysseus was away from the shore, Hermes arrived. He was the messenger of the gods."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s3-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Calypso knew the messenger before he spoke."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s3-p3",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "calypso",
          "text": "“Hermes. What have the gods decided?”",
          "listener": "hermes"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s3-clarity-decision",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "The gods had decided that Odysseus should have a chance to go home. Hermes had come to tell Calypso their decision."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s3-p4",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "hermes",
          "text": "“The man must be allowed to leave.”",
          "listener": "calypso"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s3-p5",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "calypso",
          "text": "“They remember him now?”",
          "listener": "hermes"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s3-p6",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Hermes let the question rest between them."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s3-p7",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "hermes",
          "text": "“You must help him prepare. The crossing itself will still be his.”",
          "listener": "calypso"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s3-look-toward-the-water",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 1000,
          "effects": {
            "actors": {
              "calypso": {
                "facing": "back"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s3-p8",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Calypso turned toward the water where Odysseus had looked for so many mornings."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s3-p9",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "There would be no ship waiting for him. No crew. No promise of a gentle sea."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s3-p10",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Only permission to try. After all these years, it was enough to change the day."
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 79
    },
    {
