          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s4-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "After Hermes left, Calypso called Odysseus back. She gave him wood, tools and rope so he could build his own raft."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s4-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "calypso",
          "text": "“A raft is a small thing to put between yourself and the sea.”"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s4-p3",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "odysseus",
          "text": "“Then I will have to make it carefully.”"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s4-work-the-bindings",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 2600,
          "effects": {
            "working": 1,
            "actors": {
              "odysseus": {
                "x": 710,
                "y": 1075,
                "facing": "right",
                "pose": "reach"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s4-p4",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "He knelt beside the timber and worked the bindings tight."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s4-p5",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Four days went into the wood: measuring, joining, checking the same knots again."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s4-p6",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "His hands remembered how to make something that might hold."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s4-raise-the-sail",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 2300,
          "effects": {
