            "tools": {
              "visible": 0
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s4-p8",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "The raft stood ready on the sand, with water and provisions secured on its timber."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s4-p9",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "calypso",
          "text": "“I cannot promise what you will find.”"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s4-p10",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "odysseus",
          "text": "“Neither can I.”"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s4-p11",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "For the first time, the next morning would be different."
        }
      ],
