          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s5-p7",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "The small sail filled. The water opened between him and the shore."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s5-p8",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "He had no map that could promise the end of this journey."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s5-p9",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "But the wind was moving him. For today, that was enough."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c1-s5-p10",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Beyond the island, the sea widened. Somewhere across it, a house was still waiting."
        },
